    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a two-player game played on a single computer, where each player controls rods to hit the soccer ball into the opponent\u2019s goal and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an \u201cimpostor control\u201d mechanic, where neither player can control their own defensive rods \u2014 only the opponent can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features frictionless, fully elastic collisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is merely my undergraduate graduation project. If the sales exceed $2 million, I will create a world-changing VR game.</p>",
